          "excerpt": "Clarence 1948– American jurist",
          "tier": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "transfer",
          "url": "https://magazine.holycross.edu/stories/remarks-justice-clarence-thomas-71-academic-convocation",
          "title": "Remarks by Justice Clarence Thomas '71 at Academic Convocation",
          "published_at": null,
          "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
          "excerpt": "I made many, many anxious calls to Holy Cross that summer of 1968. I arrived by bus in the fall.",
